<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Innkeepers USA rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Innkeepers USA rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Ryan, Beck &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of Innkeepers USA Trust with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated funds from operations of $1.24 per share for 1996, $1.40 for 1997, and $1.55 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- set price target of $15.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed unchanged at 12-5/8 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- The company is a Florida-based real estate investment trust that owns 32 hotels around the U.S.</p>
</text>
